# Local Claude Code session state -- machine-local, not project config.
.claude/

# Terraform
infra/.terraform/
infra/*.tfstate
infra/*.tfstate.*
infra/.terraform.lock.hcl
infra/*.tfvars
!infra/*.tfvars.example
infra/crash.log
infra/crash.*.log
infra/tfplan*

# Firebase service-account private keys (NOT google-services.json, which is public config)
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
*service-account*.json

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Mobile audit raw screenshots (kept locally, too large to commit)
docs/mobile-audit/screens/

# QA screenshots live outside the repo: "..\Court Booking App - QA screenshots\" (.md reports, scripts and json stay tracked)
docs/floodlight-qa/**/*.png
docs/mobile-audit/p0-after/

# Audit screenshots (docs/full-audit-2026-10-28.md); kept local only
docs/audit-screens/
# App UI audit 2026-10-31: screenshots and raw check results stay local; only the report (index.md) may be committed
docs/ui-audit-app-2026-10-31/*
!docs/ui-audit-app-2026-10-31/index.md
# Device (emulator) UI audit 2026-10-31: screenshots stay local; only the report (index.md) may be committed
docs/ui-audit-device-2026-10-31/*
!docs/ui-audit-device-2026-10-31/index.md

# Design vs app comparison (renders, emulator shots, side-by-side images) stays local
docs/design-vs-app/*
!docs/design-vs-app/index.md
